              "name": "ashley21"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was very good. The combination of flavors was excellent. I added some chopped onion and celery also. If you like your stuffing to really stick together than you need to double the butter sauce and bake it in a smaller baking dish. I personally like my stuffing broken apart, it gives it a lighter flavor. Thanks for posting!!"
